1. PURPOSE AND SCOPE / MANUFA DA IYAKA
EN — This policy defines how authorized ALBUKHR Finance Administrators review withdrawal requests, document decisions, record verified manual Pi payouts, and handle uncertain payment outcomes. It applies to the Mainnet admin withdrawal workflow. It does not authorize automatic A2U payments or change payment configuration. HA — Wannan policy yana bayyana yadda Financial Admin mai izini zai duba withdrawal requests, rubuta dalilan hukunci, tabbatar da manual Pi payout da aka yi, da kula da sakamakon biyan kuɗi da bai tabbata ba. Ya shafi tsarin withdrawals na Mainnet. Ba ya ba da izinin kunna A2U payment ko canza payment settings.
2. CORE FINANCIAL PRINCIPLES / MUHIMMAN KA'IDOJIN KUƊI
EN — Accuracy; least privilege; AAL2/MFA; strict Mainnet/Testnet isolation; no duplicate payout; server/database authority over frontend display; evidence-based decisions; auditability; and separation between approval and payment. HA — Daidaito; ƙaramin izini da ake buƙata; AAL2/MFA; raba Mainnet da Testnet; hana biyan kuɗi sau biyu; fifita hukuncin server/database kan abin da UI kawai ya nuna; yanke hukunci bisa shaida; kiyaye tarihin audit; da bambance amincewa da biyan kuɗi.
3. ROLES AND PERMISSIONS / MATSAYI DA IZINI
EN — The inspected page checks for an authenticated admin and AAL2/MFA. Finance Admin and Super Admin are the intended roles for payment-recording and reconciliation actions. Approval Admin may review requests but must not be treated as authorized to mark a withdrawal paid. Backend RPC authorization remains authoritative and must be verified independently. HA — Shafin da aka duba yana tantance authenticated admin da AAL2/MFA. Finance Admin da Super Admin su ne aka tsara su yi ayyukan rubuta payment da reconciliation. Approval Admin na iya duba requests, amma kada a ɗauke shi a matsayin mai izinin sanya withdrawal a matsayin paid. Kariyar RPC a backend ita ce ainihin kariya, kuma dole a tabbatar da ita daban.
4. WITHDRAWAL LIFECYCLE / JERIN MATAKAN WITHDRAWAL
EN — 1) Pending: open the request from the protected queue and check identity, request ID, project/stake, requested amount, fee, net amount, wallet, maturity and network. 2) Review: approve or reject, recording a reason where applicable. 3) Approved: approval does not send Pi; independently verify payout eligibility and safety flags. 4) Manual payout: follow only the authorized existing payment procedure after independent wallet and amount verification. 5) Paid record: after confirming the transaction actually completed, record the correct blockchain TXID and finance note. 6) Reconcile: investigate mismatches before further payout action. HA — 1) Pending: buɗe request daga protected queue, a duba identity, request ID, project/stake, requested amount, fee, net amount, wallet, maturity da network. 2) Review: a approve ko reject, a rubuta dalili idan ya dace. 3) Approved: amincewa ba ta aika Pi; a sake tabbatar da cancantar payout da safety flags. 4) Manual payout: a bi hanyar payment da aka amince da ita bayan tabbatar da wallet da adadi daban. 5) Paid record: bayan tabbatar transaction ya kammala, a rubuta blockchain TXID da finance note. 6) Reconcile: a binciki rashin daidaito kafin wani matakin payout.
5. APPROVAL AND REJECTION / AMINCEWA DA ƘIN REQUEST
EN — Before approving, confirm the authenticated Mainnet user, absence of duplicate requests, consistent amount/fee fields, plausible stake and maturity, intended destination wallet, and no blocking policy or safety restriction. Record a specific rejection reason. Never edit financial values directly from the browser or bypass protected RPCs. HA — Kafin approve, a tabbatar request na authenticated Mainnet user ne; babu duplicate; adadi da fee sun yi daidai; stake da maturity sun dace; wallet shi ne wanda aka nufa; kuma babu policy ko safety restriction da ta hana review. Idan an reject, a rubuta takamaiman dalili. Kada a gyara bayanan kuɗi kai tsaye daga browser ko a tsallake protected RPC.
6. MANUAL PI PAYMENT CONTROL / KARIYAR MANUAL PI PAYOUT
EN — Mark a request PAID only after the actual manual payment is independently verified. Confirm recipient wallet, amount, network, transaction result and TXID. A TXID is evidence to record, not permission to pay. Do not mark paid based on intention, a screenshot alone, a pending transaction, or an unverified claim. If TXID is missing or disputed, leave unresolved and escalate. HA — A sanya request PAID ne kawai bayan an tabbatar da manual payment da gaske. A tabbatar wallet, adadi, network, sakamakon transaction da TXID. TXID shaida ce da za a rubuta, ba izinin biyan kuɗi ba. Kada a sanya paid bisa niyya, screenshot kaɗai, transaction mai jiran kammalawa, ko ikirarin da ba a tabbatar ba. Idan TXID ya ɓace ko ana jayayya a kansa, a bar shi unresolved sannan a tura batun.
7. A2U RECONCILIATION / RECONCILIATION DA HANA BIYA SAU BIYU
EN — The reconciliation panel is a read-only worklist; it does not send, reverse, complete or confirm Pi payments. If an A2U attempt is processing/completed, an external payment ID or TXID exists, payment creation/submission may have started, or the outcome is uncertain, do not manually pay and do not retry automatically. Missing TXID or worker error alone does not prove that no payment occurred. Reconcile against authoritative server-side Pi payment records, document evidence and obtain authorized resolution before changing state. HA — Reconciliation panel jerin bincike ne na read-only; ba ya aika, soke, kammala ko tabbatar da Pi payment. Idan A2U attempt yana processing/completed, akwai payment ID ko TXID, an iya fara payment creation/submission, ko sakamakon bai tabbata ba, kada a yi manual payout ko automatic retry. Rashin TXID ko worker error shi kaɗai ba hujjar cewa ba a aika kuɗi ba ce. A daidaita da authoritative Pi payment records na server, a rubuta shaida, a samu izinin warware matsalar kafin canza state.
8. AMOUNTS AND FEES / ADADI DA FEES
EN — Review requested amount, fee, total deduction and wallet receive as distinct values. Do not override the active server fee policy in the UI. If amounts conflict across the queue, request, database or payment record, stop and escalate. Displayed values are not final proof of balance or eligibility. HA — A duba requested amount, fee, total deduction da wallet receive a matsayin bayanai daban-daban. Kada a override active server fee policy daga UI. Idan adadi ya saɓa tsakanin queue, request, database ko payment record, a dakata a tura batun. Adadin da UI ya nuna ba shi kaɗai ne hujjar ƙarshe ta balance ko eligibility ba.
9. AUDIT TRAIL / TARIHIN AUDIT
EN — Use protected review/payment RPCs. Preserve request ID, decision, reviewer identity, timestamp, reason, amount/fee/net values, recipient wallet, TXID, evidence reference and reconciliation outcome where supported. Never put secrets, access tokens or private keys in notes. Do not delete or overwrite financial history to conceal discrepancies. HA — A yi amfani da protected review/payment RPCs. A adana request ID, hukunci, reviewer identity, lokaci, dalili, amount/fee/net, wallet, TXID, reference na shaida da sakamakon reconciliation gwargwadon abin da tsarin ke tallafawa. Kada a saka secrets, access tokens ko private keys a notes. Kada a goge ko a maye gurbin tarihin kuɗi domin ɓoye matsala.
10. INCIDENTS AND ESCALATION / MATSALOLI DA TURAWA
EN — Stop the affected payout path and escalate if there is a duplicate request, unexpected wallet, amount mismatch, missing/invalid TXID, uncertain external payment, missing safety flags, unavailable reconciliation queue, suspected unauthorized access, or Mainnet/Testnet mismatch. Preserve evidence and avoid repeated payment attempts during investigation. HA — A dakatar da payout ɗin da abin ya shafa, a tura batun idan akwai duplicate request, wallet da ba a zata ba, saɓanin adadi, TXID da ya ɓace/ba daidai ba, external payment da bai tabbata ba, safety flags sun ɓace, reconciliation queue ba ya aiki, zargin shiga ba tare da izini ba, ko rikicewar Mainnet/Testnet. A kiyaye shaida, kada a maimaita payout yayin bincike.
11. SECURITY AND NETWORK BOUNDARIES / TSARO DA NETWORK
EN — This workflow is Mainnet-only and must require the intended authenticated admin, AAL2/MFA and server-side role checks. Never mix Mainnet and Testnet data. Do not enable A2U or alter payment environment variables, worker deployment, SQL or payout RPCs as part of adopting this policy. Implementation changes require a separately reviewed, tested and explicitly authorized change plan. HA — Wannan workflow na Mainnet ne kawai, kuma dole ya buƙaci authenticated admin, AAL2/MFA da role checks a server. Kada a haɗa bayanan Mainnet da Testnet. Kada a kunna A2U ko canza payment environment variables, worker deployment, SQL ko payout RPCs saboda wannan policy. Canjin implementation yana buƙatar nasa change plan da aka duba, gwada, kuma aka ba da izini a sarari.
12. OBSERVED IMPLEMENTATION / ABUBUWAN DA AKA GANI A CODE
EN — The inspected admin HTML/JavaScript shows a protected withdrawal queue; approve/reject actions; a Finance/Super Admin payment-recording path requiring a TXID; AAL2/MFA initialization; and a read-only A2U reconciliation panel. The JavaScript fails closed when the manual-payment safety flag is missing or blocked. These are source-code observations, not proof that every deployed database/RPC control is correct. HA — HTML/JavaScript na Admin da aka duba ya nuna protected withdrawal queue; approve/reject; hanyar rubuta payment ga Finance/Super Admin da ke buƙatar TXID; AAL2/MFA; da read-only A2U reconciliation panel. JavaScript yana kulle payout idan safety flag ya ɓace ko ya nuna an toshe. Waɗannan abubuwan da aka gani a source code ne, ba tabbacin cewa duk database/RPC controls na production sun yi daidai ba.
13. OPEN VERIFICATION ITEMS / ABUBUWAN DA AKE BUƘATAR TABBATARWA
EN — Before approval, independently verify deployed admin/API versions; database definitions and grants for review/mark-paid/reconciliation RPCs; AAL2 enforcement at the server/database boundary; audit-log completeness; live queue behavior for authorized roles; duplicate-payment guard for all attempt states; and staging tests for approve, reject, mark-paid, repeat submission and uncertain payment. Never test with real funds. HA — Kafin amincewa, a tabbatar da admin/API versions da aka deploy; definitions da grants na review/mark-paid/reconciliation RPCs; AAL2 enforcement a server/database; cikar audit log; halayen live queue ga roles masu izini; kariyar hana duplicate payout a duk attempt states; da staging tests na approve, reject, mark-paid, repeat submission da uncertain payment. Kada a gwada da kuɗi na gaske.
14. FINANCE ADMIN CHECKLIST / JERIN TANTANCEWA
EN — Before review: verify Mainnet, identity, request ID, amount, fee, wallet, maturity and duplicate status. Before approval: record a reason where needed and confirm the review RPC succeeded. Before manual payout: confirm no payout lock/reconciliation flag, independently verify recipient and amount, and follow the approved existing process. After payment: verify completion, record the correct TXID/note, refresh the queue and match final state to evidence. If uncertain: stop, preserve evidence and escalate. HA — Kafin review: tabbatar Mainnet, identity, request ID, adadi, fee, wallet, maturity da duplicate status. Kafin approval: rubuta dalili idan ya dace, a tabbatar review RPC ya yi nasara. Kafin manual payout: tabbatar babu payout lock/reconciliation flag, a tabbatar recipient da adadi daban, sannan a bi hanyar da aka amince da ita. Bayan payment: tabbatar an kammala, a rubuta TXID/note, a refresh queue, a tabbatar final state ya dace da shaida. Idan akwai shakku: a dakata, a kiyaye shaida, a tura batun.
15. DOCUMENT STATUS / MATSAYIN TAKARDA
EN — This is a repository-reviewed draft for internal governance review. It is not yet an approved production policy and does not certify a live-system audit, financial solvency, Pi eligibility, legal compliance or complete backend enforcement. Governance and Security owners must approve it and close verification items before it is labelled Approved. HA — Wannan draft ce da aka duba bisa repository domin governance review. Ba a amince da ita a matsayin production policy ba tukuna, kuma ba ta tabbatar da live-system audit, wadatar kuɗi, cancantar Pi, bin doka ko cikakkiyar kariyar backend. Masu alhakin Governance da Security dole su amince da ita kuma su rufe abubuwan tabbatarwa kafin a sanya Approved.
